{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/82c353361582ff2fb94071a811a8bfd3.avif?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When children enter this mysterious park at midnight, there\u2019s only one option: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nightshift Survival is a challenging rogue-lite game where you will face hordes of terrifying and relentless creatures in Millennium Park. What mysteries and dangers does this place hide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.poster.avif?t=1770764120\" width=616 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.webm?t=1770764120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3920ba6a8d45933e7f3.mp4?t=1770764120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face enemies with various movement patterns, collect powerups to survive, and unlock achievements with new items and ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/52f5519ff2f8d98d2d20da917b4cec68.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Be a pacifist survivor or a hunter of the mysterious creatures with the 57 items, including weapons, trinkets, and collectibles available to build your best strategy to survive the insane nights.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.poster.avif?t=1770764120\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.webm?t=1770764120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/2346c6564f48737828be95014ab28645.mp4?t=1770764120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/7daa7e211f99d3f6c7deaef0c79b327a.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are 13 sinister enemies, ranging from harmless little toys to child-devouring mechatronic beasts, all eager to play with you. Face your fears through the nights to make it unscathed until 6AM and confront the bosses of each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/845550c23cef1a21af1b3a2cff26ee87.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With 60 achievements, unlock new possibilities to make each playthrough unique and showcase your skills as a true collector.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/366bb2554cf081f3fdc630a94b9f0572.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play and replay with different combinations of items to take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Besides everything already present in the game, get ready for planned new content. Many secrets will still be revealed in the upcoming chapters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the night shift, if you can.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survived the nightshift. Somehow.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/c953ae6141b4a5e648ad0550946dc468a7b7b48d.jpg"},{"name":"Not even close!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/ff965bd7fb4a1f57224c2bad232a20c86faa732d.jpg"},{"name":"What happened??","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/e1903f91d8efc83fdc17a3d778827ae64149d9e2.jpg"},{"name":"Bed time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/146e02a81b92ab09e34637a739a57812b0859009.jpg"},{"name":"Not again...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/261f30b75444ba1c87277a8d7eebc1df4aaa907a.jpg"},{"name":"A long night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/acc50da40e75cefa746eba0dbf388b477885dca7.jpg"},{"name":"Raining indoors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/adde91d2b442b8e5b8d02e3565b2f4bb634f1974.jpg"},{"name":"Juicy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/bc7d5bd481787cdecca4490a5ee5a499f1a786d8.jpg"},{"name":"Five stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/7374d863339ef2139373d5b3e6be355698c07f81.jpg"},{"name":"Prestige","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2480000/f41bd2427565d0c446a6421eedc95361f59c4a93.jpg"}],"total":60},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2480000?t=1770764120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770764120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770764120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770764120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/82c353361582ff2fb94071a811a8bfd3.avif?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When children enter this mysterious park at midnight, there\u2019s only one option: <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nightshift Survival is a challenging rogue-lite game where you will face hordes of terrifying and relentless creatures in Millennium Park. What mysteries and dangers does this place hide?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/12187dbe181ce3