em_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/7daa7e211f99d3f6c7deaef0c79b327a.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are 13 sinister enemies, ranging from harmless little toys to child-devouring mechatronic beasts, all eager to play with you. Face your fears through the nights to make it unscathed until 6AM and confront the bosses of each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/845550c23cef1a21af1b3a2cff26ee87.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With 60 achievements, unlock new possibilities to make each playthrough unique and showcase your skills as a true collector.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/extras/366bb2554cf081f3fdc630a94b9f0572.webp?t=1770764120\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play and replay with different combinations of items to take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Besides everything already present in the game, get ready for planned new content. Many secrets will still be revealed in the upcoming chapters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the night shift, if you can.</strong></p>","developers":["Nebula Devs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480000/header.jpg?t=1770764120","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":